# Grock, Fortress Titan

> Grock after the revamp is a different hero. The old version leaned on walls for defense and control immunity; the new one brings the wall with him and splits his damage into Physical Attack burst and defense-scaled percent-Max-HP hits. That changes how you draft him, how you initiate, and where on the map you are allowed to die.

