## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Conceal Wall Engage (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Athena's Shield, Blade Armor, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Athena's Shield
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Rapid Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy has low control and Grock needs faster flank angles before Turtle fights.; Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against repeated magic ticks, burn damage, or poke patterns that outlast Athena's single burst window.; Guardian Helmet over Blade Armor when Use when Grock is winning vision but reaching every objective fight too low to start.
- Total cost: 11060 gold

Default ranked roam setup that gives Grock Conceal angles, Flicker correction, and enough mixed defense to force wall collisions without dying first.

### Dire Hit Tempo Tank (Roam)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Radiant Armor, Guardian Helmet, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Radiant Armor
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Execute
- Blessing: Dire Hit
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when stuns and slows are stopping Grock before he can place Earthen Rampart.; Athena's Shield over Radiant Armor when Use when a single burst mage decides fights before Radiant Armor can stack value.; Blade Armor over Guardian Helmet when Use against basic-attack marksmen who must hit Grock while he zones the wall corridor.
- Total cost: 11050 gold

Snowball roam variant for games where Grock crosses the map often enough to arrive with Force capped. Bastion of Stone, Thunder Belt, and the Dire Hit dump can all ride the same Basic Attack, and Execute finishes what that leaves.

### EXP Burst Wall Pick (EXP)

- Items: Rapid Boots, Sky Piercer, Blade of the Heptaseas, Blade of Despair, Rose Gold Meteor, Malefic Roar
- Core: Sky Piercer, Blade of the Heptaseas, Blade of Despair
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Master Assassin, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Execute
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Rapid Boots when Use into physical EXP lanes where trading durability matters more than map speed.; Brute Force Breastplate over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when Grock needs control duration reduction and a safer second entry instead of a Lifeline shield.; Antique Cuirass over Malefic Roar when Use when Grock is no longer deleting carries and must become the secondary frontline.
- Total cost: 11090 gold

Side-lane burst setup for drafts with another main tank, built to punish immobile mages or marksmen after Earthen Rampart creates the wall angle.

